      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "モンスター娘たちの助力を得て、\n簀巻きとなって転がっている海賊たちを見て、\nビビ神は満足げに微笑む。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "15dcb22ee754532a6a6ee0113132e1fee9e963ddeb62ce7a703c037c84306d9d",
